msgid "WooCommerce Organization Accounts Pro"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: woo-organization-accounts-pro.php
msgid "https://github.com/SourovCodes/woo-organization-accounts-pro"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: woo-organization-accounts-pro.php
msgid "Turns WooCommerce into a strict organization-based B2B system: organization accounts, members, locations, centralised billing and organization-scoped orders."
msgstr "Macht WooCommerce zu einem strikt organisationsbasierten B2B-System: Organisationskonten, Mitglieder, Standorte, zentrale Rechnungsadresse und organisationsbezogene Bestellungen."

